[h1]johns.game General Info[/h1]
To see new in-game info, controls, ammo, & guns, check out the [i]'Wasteland In-game Info Discussion'[/i] under Discussions. Its a very helpful little thread that will give you almost all info you will ever need.

The Store Page has been updated as of the description and the screenshots but creating a trailer is a fairly hard feat and I feel like we need to add a whole lot more before we have another need for a trailer unless someone wants to volenteer to create one.

[h1]Some Sad News: A Goodbye[/h1]
I am sorry to say that the man behind the music is now no longer able to create music. The amazing tracks we were given are now the last from him... forever. For those of you who loved these tracks I am sorry, I loved them too. That is why there will be ways for you to find these tracks in-game at some point and that one of the OG Tracks of his will be the main title music in 2.0.3 
because we love ANIMAUL. 

[h1]Bob and Weave[/h1]
So two of my favourite people on Steam are creating a channel called [i]'Bob and Weave'[/i]. Now I am not sure what their content is actually about but I do trust they will be, hopefully, good videos. So if you care to look at a new channel and maybe get something light on games in your life go check them out. [url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8zhwbFt_bfM] Bob and Weave[/url]

thats all, please read all of the notes below and good luck. The world is much to hard for you now!

