[h1]johns.game:[b]New Update, News[/b][/h1]
The new update has finally released but there is a twist, it's a new game. I have been spending the last few weeks working on both games but I got fed up on johns.game for many reasons including its name. The update has changed the entirety of the game from cooking, to collisions. It's, for the most part, fixed and changed. I am currently re-creating the entire world from the worlds name to the quests that you find. Currently, you spawn in a very small area that you can, at the same time, do a few things to get used to how the game will play and the world will work before the full world is complete. The name of the game is currently being voted on to be changed because jonhs.game is just a URL name that's not a very good name, to begin with.
The Current Names are:
Wasteland King
OASIS
Wastelander
Life is a game
if you have another idea for a name please feel free to comment.
Most of these updates you will find quicker at our twitter so go us a follow!

Thats all, please read all of the notes below and good luck. The world is much to hard for you now!ː2015hollyːːSBpandaː

